      <div class="dp-cover-eyebrow">bearerCORE™ · Security Specification</div>
      <h1>Environments &amp; Security</h1>
      <p class="dp-cover-desc">
        bearerCORE enforces a strict operational separation between
        Training/Sandbox, Pilot/Staging, and Production to isolate non-settlement
        testing from real-world financial effects — backed by role-based access
        control (RBAC), multi-factor authentication (TOTP), and RTGS settlement
        isolation. The server is the sole authority; the desktop client mirrors
        the posture for defence-in-depth.
      </p>
      <div class="dp-cover-meta">
        <div>Version <b>1.0</b></div>
        <div>Updated <b>August 2026</b></div>
        <div>Status <b>Live</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
